here you are currently behind.\n\nReason:\nYour hand has very low showdown value (Jack high) and only marginal drawing potential (gutshot straight draw). Since the opponent checked, taking a free card to try and improve on the Turn is the most prudent play. There is no need to bloat the pot with a weak hand.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
