hich is not strategically sound.\n\nReason: With a weak hand like J5 offsuit, the most profitable play is to accept the free look at the flop by checking. This avoids risking more chips pre-flop while retaining the potential to hit a lucky flop (like two pair or three of a kind).\n\nAnswer: 0'}
