ou to see the River card without investing more chips, preserving your stack while you are in the lead.\n\nReason: Your hand is currently very weak (High Card), but the opponent has shown no aggression. Checking is the safest play to see the final card for free, minimizing risk while maintaining the possibility of winning at showdown or improving on the River.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
